{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I need to carefully parse this complex question. Let me break it down:\n\n1. There's a book (Book A) that was a contender for an award\n2. The award itself was originally created in the 2000s\n3. Book A was translated into over 25 languages\n4. In the 2010s, in the year Book A was published, another book (Book B) won the award\n5. Book B had been released the preceding year\n6. The author of Book B was born in the same city where the author of Book A grew up\n7. Question: In what city was the author of Book A born?\n\nLet me start searching for clues about awards created in the 2000s.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"literary award created 2000s translated twenty five languages\", \"book award established 2000s contender translated over 25 languages\", \"international literary prize founded 2000s\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_62c9b779b8e944d6a3d6d239","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"book translated into over 25 languages award contender 2010s\", \"novel translated 25 languages prize shortlist 2010s\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_f2ffd972b23e4e2d9ba0e545","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789460450,"id":"chatcmpl-76deada7-073a-9ef5-bef7-f012e5c7b837","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":3870,"completion_tokens":250,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4120,"cached_tokens":0,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}